{"text": "Hansel y Gretel acompañaron a su padre a recoger leña. Él les pidió esperar junto a un árbol mientras revisaba un sendero. Los hermanos vieron unas bayas y se alejaron sin avisar para mirarlas más de cerca. Gretel: No nos alejemos mucho del árbol.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.655499, "from": 0, "to": 6}, {"start": 0.670291, "end": 0.7145819, "from": 7, "to": 8}, {"start": 0.729333, "end": 1.201916, "from": 9, "to": 15}, {"start": 1.216708, "end": 2.043749, "from": 16, "to": 27}, {"start": 2.0585, "end": 2.1027909, "from": 28, "to": 29}, {"start": 2.117583, "end": 2.280041, "from": 30, "to": 32}, {"start": 2.294791, "end": 2.678791, "from": 33, "to": 38}, {"start": 2.693541, "end": 2.7378319, "from": 39, "to": 40}, {"start": 2.752625, "end": 3.313833, "from": 41, "to": 48}, {"start": 3.328583, "end": 3.771624, "from": 49, "to": 53}, {"start": 4.79975, "end": 5.0065, "from": 55, "to": 57}, {"start": 5.02125, "end": 5.21325, "from": 58, "to": 61}, {"start": 5.228041, "end": 5.538166, "from": 62, "to": 67}, {"start": 5.552916, "end": 6.025499, "from": 68, "to": 75}, {"start": 6.040291, "end": 6.379957, "from": 76, "to": 81}, {"start": 6.39475, "end": 6.424291, "from": 82, "to": 83}, {"start": 6.439041, "end": 6.645791, "from": 84, "to": 86}, {"start": 6.660541, "end": 7.044541, "from": 87, "to": 92}, {"start": 7.059291, "end": 7.546666, "from": 93, "to": 101}, {"start": 7.561416, "end": 8.166916, "from": 102, "to": 110}, {"start": 8.181708, "end": 8.358916, "from": 111, "to": 113}, {"start": 8.373708, "end": 8.993999, "from": 114, "to": 121}, {"start": 10.013, "end": 10.278833, "from": 123, "to": 126}, {"start": 10.293583, "end": 10.810458, "from": 127, "to": 135}, {"start": 10.82525, "end": 11.164916, "from": 136, "to": 142}, {"start": 11.179708, "end": 11.475083, "from": 143, "to": 147}, {"start": 11.489833, "end": 11.947666, "from": 148, "to": 153}, {"start": 11.962416, "end": 12.036249, "from": 154, "to": 155}, {"start": 12.051041, "end": 12.18